  "description": "Hybrid/MAUI-specific extensions for Blazouter routing library. This package provides optimized components and integration for Blazor Hybrid applications running on .NET MAUI. Enables React Router-like routing features in native mobile and desktop apps with full support for nested routes, guards, lazy loading, and platform-specific optimizations. Works on iOS, Android, macOS, and Windows platforms.",
